    "en": {
      "trackName": "Cut The Light",
      "description": "In \"Cut The Light\", you're tasked to switch off all the lights on the board with the least moves possible.\nStart your journey with a 3x3 grid and progress to more complex levels up to a 5x5 board, each offering a unique challenge that will test your puzzle-solving prowess.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Progressive Difficulty: Begin with a 3x3 board and advance through 4x4 to the challenging 5x5 grid.\n- Engaging Mechanics: Tap to toggle lights, affecting adjacent lights. Can you turn them all off?\n- Customizable Play: Choose your initial board size to match your desired difficulty.\n- Solve Function: Stuck on a level? Use the solve button for a hint without spoiling the fun.\n- No Interruptions: Enjoy uninterrupted playtime and resume where you left off – focus purely on your strategy.\n\nWhether you're a puzzle novice or a seasoned strategist, \"Cut The Light\" offers endless hours of brain-teasing fun. Celebrate your victories as you move from simple to complex levels, with a congratulatory showcase awaiting your success.\n\nReady to challenge your mind and cut all the lights?\n\nDownload now and immerse yourself in the quest for darkness!\n\nNo Distractions, Just Pure Puzzle Fun.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
